<section id="faqSection" class="section-padding faq-section" aria-label="Frequently Asked Questions">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-tag"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-question"></i> CLIENT CONCIERGE</span>
      <h2>Frequently Asked <span class="gold-text">Questions</span></h2>
      <p>Everything you need to know about our movements, shipping, warranties, and sizing.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-accordion-list">
      <!-- FAQ 1 -->
      <div class="faq-item active">
        <button class="faq-trigger" aria-expanded="true">
          <span>How does the automatic mechanical movement work? Does it require batteries?</span>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down"></i>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-content">
          Our automatic watches (such as the Pagani Classic Dive) are powered entirely by an internal oscillating rotor that winds the mainspring automatically as you move your arm throughout the day. It requires zero batteries. If unworn for over 41 hours, you can simply wind the crown 20-30 turns manually to initiate power.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 2 -->
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>Is the 100M water resistance safe for swimming and diving?</span>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down"></i>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-content">
          Yes. The Pagani Classic Dive features a 100M (10 BAR) hydrostatic rating with a threaded screw-down crown and dual synthetic O-ring gaskets. It is fully tested for recreational swimming, snorkeling, and water sports. Simply ensure the crown is screwed down tight before entering water.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 3 -->
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>Is the synthetic sapphire crystal truly scratch-proof?</span>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down"></i>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-content">
          Yes. Synthetic sapphire crystal rates a 9 on the Mohs hardness scale (diamond is 10). Everyday metals, keys, granite countertops, and zipper teeth cannot scratch it. Your watch glass will remain crystal clear and pristine for decades.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 4 -->
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>How long does insured shipping take and is Cash on Delivery (COD) available?</span>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down"></i>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-content">
          Orders are dispatched within 24 hours of atelier timing inspection. Domestic delivery in Pakistan takes 2–4 business days with Cash on Delivery (COD) available. Worldwide express courier (DHL / FedEx Express) takes 3–5 business days with full transit insurance.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 5 -->
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>How do I adjust the stainless steel bracelet to fit my wrist?</span>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down"></i>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-content">
          Every watch order includes a complimentary precision brass pin adjustment tool and guide. You can effortlessly remove or add links at home in under 2 minutes, or request your wrist measurement during checkout for complimentary atelier pre-sizing.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

